AUTHORS
=======

Super Smash Flash (2006): written, designed, and published by the
maintainer of this repository, credited at the time as Clood 9 of
McLeodGaming. Original .swf archived by the same at
archive.org, item `supersmashflash_swf`.

Source recovery, tooling, and this repository: same person, 2026,
assisted by modern tools (JPEXS FFDec, Ruffle). The recovery method is
documented in docs/NOTES.md so anyone can re-derive every file here
from the original .swf.

Nintendo, HAL Laboratory, Creatures Inc., GAME FREAK, APE Inc., Disney,
Square Enix, Sega, Capcom, Sunrise, Namco, Studio Pierrot, Equinox
Twilight: owners of the characters this game once drew. They are not
authors of this repository and nothing here licenses their work.
